    {
      "target": "개개인마다 취향이 달라요.",
      "reading": "gaegaeinmada chuihyangi dallyayo.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Everyone has different tastes.",
        "ko": "개개인마다 취향이 달라요.",
        "ipa": "gaegaeinmada chuihyangi dallyayo.",
        "ar": "لكل شخص ذوق مختلف.",
        "cs": "Každý má jiný vkus.",
